NOTE ON SCOPE / 适用范围说明

This license covers only the original code of this Android port (the Java
sources under `core/`, the Android app under `app/`, and the build/generation
scripts under `tools/`).

It does NOT cover the upstream protocol constants, channel identifiers, or
signing material ported from "ysp-live v9.5" by Gary's Club, nor any video
content. Those remain the property of their respective rights holders.

本许可仅适用于本项目原创的 Android 移植代码。从 Gary's Club 的 ysp-live v9.5
移植而来的协议常量、频道标识、签名材料，以及任何视频内容，均不在本许可范围内，
其权利归各自权利人所有。
